@@ -0,0 +1,9 @@
+# Writing styles overview
+
+A style is a reusable post-processing prompt. Select a style before dictating, configure a style per app, or select one directly with a style hotkey.
+
+## Switching styles
+
+Open **Settings → Style hotkeys** to assign a global shortcut to each style. During a manual dictation, the optional **Switch style while dictating** setting lets you hold the dictate activation key and press Left or Right Arrow to cycle active styles.
+
+A style can include optional category, output-length, and input/output example guidance. These fields are additive; styles created in older versions continue to use their free-form prompt unchanged.
